# Project TITAN V1.3 — Detail Popup Layout (FINAL)

**SSoT (code):** `src/config/detailPopupPolicy.js` · `src/config/masterDetailLayoutPolicy.js` · `TitanDetailPopup` · `TitanScreenDetailPopup`

**Supersedes:** Row Summary Cards · Left Widget · Bottom expand panels

---

## UI 철학 (최종 확정)

| 구분 | 레이아웃 |
|------|----------|
| **HOME Dashboard** | 🟢 UI Freeze — Widget 중심 Dashboard **유지** |
| **모든 관리 페이지** | 검색 → 리스트 → **작업 [상세]** + toolbar actions |

```text
검색
  ↓
리스트 (Table) — 메인 · 마지막 컬럼 [작업]
  ↓
[상세] 클릭 → MUI Dialog (xl) · Tabs · [닫기]
```

---

## Cursor Do Not

- HOME 제외 관리 페이지에 `TitanListWorkspace` · 좌측 Widget
- `TitanMasterDetailShell` · Collapse Panel · 리스트 하단 Row Summary Card
- Row-specific actions in top toolbar (toolbar = register · print/export · bulk only)

## List row interaction (V1.3 공통 UX)

| 동작 | 기능 |
|------|------|
| **클릭** | Row 선택 · Highlight |
| **더블클릭** | 상세조회 Popup (`openRowDetailPopup`) |
| **[수정] 버튼** | 수정 화면만 |
| **[등록] 버튼** | 신규 등록 |
| **완료/출고/발행** | 상태 변경 |

- Helper: `src/foundation/utils/openRowDetailPopup.js`
- **더블클릭으로 수정(Edit) 진입 금지**

## Cursor Do

- `TitanTableRowActions` — **[상세]** first + page row actions
- `TitanDetailPopup` / `TitanScreenDetailPopup` — MUI Dialog maxWidth xl · 80%×85%
- Tab panels: `src/foundation/components/detailPopup/DetailPopupPanels.jsx`
- Reuse traceability from `TitanProductRowSummary` logic via popup panels
- Footer: **[닫기]** only

---

## Popup spec

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| Width | ~80% (max 1800px) |
| Height | ~85% (max 95vh) |
| Component | MUI `Dialog` maxWidth="xl" |
| Header | e.g. "생산관리 상세정보" |
| Body | Tab bar + scrollable tab content |
| Footer | [닫기] only |

